{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"languages":["occ"],"tokens":[{"text":"- (","kind":"text"},{"text":"void","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:v"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"setMaximumAmbientCacheSize:","kind":"identifier"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"NSUInteger","preciseIdentifier":"c:@T@NSUInteger"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"cacheSize"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"withCompletionHandler:","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"void","preciseIdentifier":"c:v","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" (^)(","kind":"text"},{"text":"NSError","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSError","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" *","kind":"text"},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"error"},{"kind":"text","text":")) "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"completion"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}]}]},{"parameters":[{"name":"cacheSize","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The maximum size in bytes for the ambient cache.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"completion","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The completion handler to call once the maximum ambient cache","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"size has been set. This handler is executed synchronously on the main queue.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This method does not limit the space available to offline packs, and data in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"offline packs does not count towards this limit. If you set the maximum ambient"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"cache size to 30 MB then download 20 MB of offline packs, 30 MB will remain"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"available for the ambient cache."}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This method should be called before the map and map style have been loaded."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This method is potentially expensive, as the database will trim cached data"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in order to prevent the ambient cache from being larger than the"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"specified amount.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflineStorage"]]},"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"occ","url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflineStorage\/setMaximumAmbientCacheSize:withCompletionHandler:"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"abstract":[{"text":"Sets the maximum ambient cache size in bytes. The default maximum cache","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"size is 50 MB. To disable ambient caching, set the maximum ambient cache size","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to ","type":"text"},{"code":"0","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". Setting the maximum ambient cache size does not impact the maximum size","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"of offline packs.","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnofflinestorage\/setmaximumambientcachesize:withcompletionhandler:"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Instance Method","externalID":"c:objc(cs)MLNOfflineStorage(im)setMaximumAmbientCacheSize:withCompletionHandler:","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}],"title":"setMaximumAmbientCacheSize:withCompletionHandler:","symbolKind":"method","fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"- "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"setMaximumAmbientCacheSize:withCompletionHandler:"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"